<title>USA: Hycor Biomedical announces establishment.</title>
<headline>Hycor Biomedical announces establishment.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hycor Biomedical Inc said it established a new French subsidiary, Hycor Biomedical SAS, and submitted product registration for allergy testing on its HY-TEC automated diagnostic system.</p>
<p>It said it expects to launch the HY-TEC system for allergy in the second quarter, assuming product approval is received within the normal cycle. Registration of our line of autoimmune disease tests on the HY-TEC system will be submitted later in the quarter.</p>
</text>
